     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem dysphagia-scales-temp</b></p><a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp\"> </a><a name=\"hcdysphagia-scales-temp\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://sefatuncer.github.io/stroke-dysphagia-fhir-ig/CodeSystem/dysphagia-scales-temp</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">PAS<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-PAS\"> </a></td><td>Penetration-Aspiration Scale (Rosenbek 1996) — score 1–8</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">FOIS<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-FOIS\"> </a></td><td>Functional Oral Intake Scale — level 1–7</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">EAT-10<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-EAT-10\"> </a></td><td>Eating Assessment Tool-10 — total score</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DIGEST<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-DIGEST\"> </a></td><td>Dynamic Imaging Grade of Swallowing Toxicity — grade 0–4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">TOR-BSST<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-TOR-BSST\"> </a></td><td>Toronto Bedside Swallowing Screening Test — pass/fail</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">YALE-RESIDUE<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-YALE-RESIDUE\"> </a></td><td>Yale Pharyngeal Residue Severity Rating</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">SILENT-ASPIRATION<a name=\"dysphagia-scales-temp-SILENT-ASPIRATION\"> </a></td><td>Silent aspiration (finding) — proposed (no SNOMED concept)</td></tr></table></div>"
